@startuml US_3_2_6_C2_Impl
title US 3.2.6 - Concluir ativacao via link (Implementacao)

node "Browser" {
  component SPA as "Activation flow\n/activation/start?token=XYZ"
}

node "TodoApi" {
  component ActivationCtrl as "ActivationController\nGET /activation/start"
}

node "IAM Provider" {
  component OIDC as "OIDC (Google)\nAuthorization Code + PKCE"
}

database DB as "PortContext\n(ActivationToken, AppUser)"

SPA --> ActivationCtrl : GET /activation/start?token
ActivationCtrl --> DB : validar token hash + expiração
ActivationCtrl --> OIDC : Challenge OIDC
OIDC --> ActivationCtrl : code + tokens
ActivationCtrl --> DB : RedeemAsync(token, sub, email)\nActive=true; store ExternalId
ActivationCtrl --> SPA : redirect sucesso ou erro\nhttps://localhost:4200/?activation=success|error
SPA --> API : /authtest/me + /api/auth/role\npara obter perfil/roles

@enduml
